pm publish --provenance&#10;&#10;npm access grant read-write &lt;team&gt; &lt;package&gt;&#10;&#10;npm deprecate &lt;package&gt;@&quot;&lt;1.2.0&quot; &quot;安全漏洞，请升级到 &gt;=1.2.0&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pack</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --provenance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> grant</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> read-write</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tea</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">packag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deprecate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">packag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@\"&#x3C;1.2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"安全漏洞，请升级到 >=1.2.0\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>.npmignore</code> 与安全敏感文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# .npmignore&#10;.env&#10;.env.*&#10;*.key&#10;*.pem&#10;*.secret&#10;.git/&#10;.github/&#10;tests/&#10;__tests__/&#10;coverage/&#10;.vscode/&#10;.idea/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># .npmignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.env.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.pem</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.git/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.github/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tests/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>__tests__/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coverage/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.vscode/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.idea/</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>npm 账号必须启用 2FA，使用细粒度 Token 并定期轮换</li>\n<li><code>ignore-scripts=true</code> 防止安装时执行恶意脚本，仅白名单放行需要编译的包</li>\n<li>私有包使用 <code>@scope</code> 前缀并配置专用注册表，防止依赖混淆攻击</li>\n<li>CI 中使用 <code>--frozen-lockfile</code> 安装，Token 通过环境变量注入而非硬编码</li>\n<li>npm provenance 提供包来源的密码学证明，增强供应链可信度</li>\n<li>发布前使用 <code>npm pack --dry-run</code> 检查发布内容，避免泄露敏感文件</li>\n<li><code>.npmrc</code> 分为项目级（提交到仓库）和用户级（含凭证，不提交），职责明确</li>\n<li>定期审查 <code>npm token list</code>，清除不再使用的 Token</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"npm 安全","id":"npm-安全"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"账号与 Token 安全","id":"账号与-token-安全"},{"level":2,"text":"install 脚本安全","id":"install-脚本安全"},{"level":2,"text":"私有注册表与 Scope 配置","id":"私有注册表与-scope-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"包发布安全","id":"包发布安全"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"依赖安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security/dependency-security"},"next":{"title":"代码完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security/code-integrity"}}